HiveMind: {
	DisplayName: Hive Mind
	Bestiary: A despicable shroom-like behemoth responsible for the vile fungi decorating the Corruption soil. It releases aggressive spores when damaged.
}

HiveMindSwooper: {
	DisplayName: Hive Swooper
	Bestiary: Released from the Hive Mind, these nasty, swooping spores serve their master to the very end.
}

HiveMindWeeper: {
	DisplayName: Hive Weeper
	Bestiary: These malevolent spores are summoned by the Hive, with their only goal being to rain hell on whoever their master deems a threat.
}

Cryogen: {
	DisplayName: Cryogen
	Bestiary: An incredible feat of magical architecture, this intricate fortress of ice and steel serves to trap a lonely soul inside...
}

SeaUrchin: {
	DisplayName: Sea Urchin
	Bestiary: Tread carefully around the ocean floor, lest you get caught in the general direction of a tumbling urchin!
}

FrostEater: {
	DisplayName: Frost Biter
	Bestiary: The ancient spirits' release has rendered the beasts of the Corruption with a stronger metabolism, enabling their spread into the coldest areas of the world.
}

Rimera: {
	DisplayName: Rimera
	Bestiary: With the ancient spirits being freed, the Crimson's terrors remain just as bloodthirsty, enough to now persist in the frigid temperatures of the snow.
}

Priest: {
	DisplayName: Priest
	Bestiary: A kindly, rather paranoid old man with a staunch belief in a higher power. Alongside his fancy wares, he'll dabble in a curious blessing or two...!
	BlessingText1: Well now, a little miracle from the lord won't do you harm! Let's see what we have...
	BlessingText2: A blessing for you, {0}? Just a tribute for the lord, that's all it takes!
	BlessingText3:
		'''
		If you're looking for some direction in your life, then
		this belief system is for you—and I can prove it!
		'''

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: "'Tis a fine day to pray!"
		NoHome: Would you perhaps have a place to stay? Maybe a town that could use the lord's wisdom?
		FarFromHome: I shouldn't have wandered so far from town without my wards and amulets...
		LoveSpace: I find it easier to commune with the lord with no one around.
		DislikeCrowded: I would prefer if all of these people went to service, instead of... just lingering about near my living quarters.
		HateCrowded: I would prefer if all of these people went to service, instead of... just lingering about near my living quarters.
		LoveBiome: My, {BiomeName} is a very beautiful place to live in. I wouldn't be surprised if it came from the heavens itself!
		HateBiome_Snow: After being trapped in that prison, I simply cannot stand the snow!
		HateBiome: I absolutely detest {BiomeName}! This place is the absence of all things holy!
		LoveNPC: I have a deep respect for {NPCName} and her commitment to purity!
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName} must have seen some awful things... I feel pity for him."
		DislikeNPC: That {NPCName} is a greedy, unkind man. Why bring him back when he was already punished?
		HateNPC: I can’t even be near {NPCName} without sensing a dark, demonic presence within him! I want nothing to do with it!
		LikeNPC_Princess: Our highness {NPCName} is pure of heart and kind to a fault.
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so earnest, and always tries to help people!"
	}
}

